# Editor and OS noise
node_modules/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# Anything that could carry a key. Turnstile, GA4 and Search Console values
# are Customizer settings, never files - keep it that way.
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Raw stock footage, not referenced by the site. The two clips the site does
# use are hero-millet.mp4 and footer-field.mp4 under assets/video/.
/Millet_and_sorghum_field_movement_*.mp4
/Millet_crops_swaying_in_breeze_*.mp4

# The commissioning documents. This repository is public; the brief and the
# blueprint are the client's internal papers, so they stay out of it and are
# held with the project files instead.
*.docx

# Packaged theme. Built from the source beside it, so it only goes stale here.
*.zip
